## Agent Deployment

### Deploy to New Client

```bash
# Full deployment (name, username, host, port)
./easem-deploy.sh laptop3 alice 192.168.1.110 22

# Or using master control
./easem-master.sh deploy laptop3 alice 192.168.1.110
```

### Setup SSH Keys Only

```bash
# Setup SSH authentication before deployment
./easem-deploy.sh --setup-ssh alice 192.168.1.110
```

---

## Configuration

### Master Configuration

Edit `master/config/easem-config.conf`:

```bash
# Master settings
MASTER_NAME="master-control"

# SSH settings
SSH_KEY_PATH="$HOME/.ssh/id_rsa"
SSH_TIMEOUT=10

# Refresh intervals
METRICS_REFRESH_INTERVAL=5
DASHBOARD_REFRESH_INTERVAL=3
CHAT_REFRESH_INTERVAL=1

# Logging
LOG_RETENTION_DAYS=7
DEBUG_MODE=0  # Set to 1 for verbose logging
```

### Client List Management

Edit `master/config/clients.list`:

```
# Format: client_name:username:hostname:port
laptop2:john:192.168.1.105:22
laptop3:alice:192.168.1.110:22
server1:admin:192.168.1.200:22
```

Add, remove, or modify clients as needed.

