## Advanced Usage

### Custom Command Whitelist

Edit `shared/easem-security.sh` to customize allowed commands:

```bash
ALLOWED_COMMANDS=(
    "ls"
    "pwd"
    # Add your custom commands here
    "docker ps"
    "kubectl get pods"
)
```

### Batch Operations

```bash
# Execute on multiple clients
for client in laptop2 laptop3 server1; do
    echo "=== $client ==="
    ./easem-master.sh exec $client "df -h /"
done
```

### Scheduled Monitoring

```bash
# Add to crontab for periodic checks
# Check every 5 minutes and log
*/5 * * * * cd /path/to/easem/master && ./easem-dashboard.sh all >> /tmp/easem-monitor.log
```

